  {
    "uuid": "62d06e4a-73d8-5b28-9e60-b614f7ba5bca",
    "entry": "春灯",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "しゅんとう",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "lamps lit at night in spring",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "春灯が灯る小道は、幻想的な雰囲気に包まれていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "夜桜の下、ぼんやりと灯る春灯がロマンチックな夜を演出していた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「この古民家の春灯、趣があっていいね。」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "白閃、春灯を裂いて右近の顔前、三寸のところに躍った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "魔像",
                "author": "新版大岡政談",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "一穂の春灯で豊かに照らされていた六畳の間は、陰士の影に鋭どく二分せられて柳行李の辺から吾輩の頭の上を越えて壁の半ばが真黒になる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "吾輩は猫である",
                "author": "夏目漱石",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "茶房暗し春灯は皆隠しあり二月十四日　銀座探勝会。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "五百五十句",
                "author": "高浜虚子",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
